prime-agent-skills-docs
=======================

Documentation and prompt-based skills for Prime Agent:
  - prime-intellect: Guides the agent on using Prime Intellect compute,
    environments, sandboxes, and inference APIs.
  - skill-creator: Guides the agent on creating and scaffolding new skills.

These skills are written in Markdown (SKILL.md + references) and do not
require a Python runtime or external dependencies.
